{
  "schema_version": "1.7.0",
  "id": "USN-9143-1",
  "summary": "mumble vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that the Murmur server in Mumble did not rate limit\ncertain client messages. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to\ncause Murmur to hang or crash, resulting in a denial of service. This\nupdate adds a message rate limit, which can be configured with the\nmessageburst and messagelimit settings.",
